---
layout: base.njk
title: Confirm your business
description: Payment confirmed — pick your Google listing so we research the right business before your Deep Dive is built.
permalink: "/thank-you/"
---
{# Post-payment confirmation gate (BOT_ARCHITECTURE.md "Paid tier — the flow",
   steps 3–5). Reads session_id from the query string, calls GET /api/confirm-business,
   and makes the buyer click their own Google listing BEFORE any report generates.
   No key ever touches this page — all lookups go through the server endpoint.
   Follows the no-verdict rule: the success panel states research is underway,
   never an outcome or finding. #}

<section class="confirm">
  <div class="confirm__inner">

    {# Loading state — shown until the lookup returns #}
    <div id="confirm-loading" class="confirm__loading" aria-live="polite">
      <h1 class="confirm__title">Payment confirmed — thank you.</h1>
      <p class="confirm__lead">Looking up your business…</p>
    </div>

    {# Populated on a successful lookup #}
    <div id="confirm-main" hidden>
      <p class="confirm__badge">Payment confirmed</p>
      <h1 class="confirm__title">One thing before we start researching.</h1>
      <p class="confirm__lead" id="confirm-prompt">Which of these is you? We research the exact business you pick — this is how we make sure your Deep Dive is about your company and no one else's.</p>

      <form id="confirm-form" class="confirm-form" novalidate>
        <fieldset class="confirm-candidates" id="confirm-candidates">
          <legend class="confirm-candidates__legend">Pick your business</legend>
          {# radio candidate cards injected by thank-you.js #}
        </fieldset>

        {# Manual entry — revealed when "None of these" is chosen #}
        <div id="confirm-manual" class="confirm-manual" hidden>
          <p class="confirm-manual__intro">No problem — tell us where to find you and we'll take it from there by hand.</p>
          <label class="confirm-manual__label" for="manual-address">Business street address</label>
          <input class="confirm-input" id="manual-address" name="manual-address" type="text" autocomplete="street-address" placeholder="123 Main St, City, ST">
          <label class="confirm-manual__label" for="manual-phone">Business phone</label>
          <input class="confirm-input" id="manual-phone" name="manual-phone" type="tel" inputmode="tel" autocomplete="tel" placeholder="(555) 555-5555">
        </div>

        <label class="confirm-attest">
          <input type="checkbox" id="confirm-attest-box">
          <span>I am the owner or an authorized representative of this business.</span>
        </label>

        <button class="button confirm-form__submit" id="confirm-submit" type="submit" disabled>Confirm and start my Deep Dive</button>
        <p class="confirm-form__msg" id="confirm-msg" aria-live="polite"></p>
      </form>
    </div>

    {# Terminal success panel — replaces the form on a recorded confirmation #}
    <div id="confirm-done" class="confirm-done" hidden aria-live="polite">
      <p class="confirm__badge">You're all set</p>
      <h2 class="confirm-done__title">Your Deep Dive is being researched now.</h2>
      {# Computed delivery deadline (report_due_display), filled by thank-you.js.
         Falls back to "within 3 business days" if the value is ever missing. #}
      <p class="confirm-done__due" id="confirm-due"></p>

      {# GBP preview — the Google data the free scan couldn't reach. Populated from
         the confirmed candidate already in memory (no new API call). Places method only. #}
      <div id="confirm-gbp" class="confirm-gbp" hidden>
        <h3 class="confirm-gbp__title">A first look at your Google listing</h3>
        <p class="confirm-gbp__intro">This is the Google Business Profile data the free scan couldn't reach — a preview. Your full Deep Dive goes deeper.</p>
        <ul class="confirm-gbp__rows" id="confirm-gbp-rows"></ul>
        <p class="confirm-gbp__finding" id="confirm-gbp-finding" hidden></p>
      </div>

      <p class="confirm-done__body">We're pulling the real, checkable details on the business you confirmed — the things you can't see from the inside — and writing them up by hand.</p>
      <p class="confirm-done__body">Nothing more to do on your end. Keep an eye on your email — and check spam once, just in case.</p>
      <p class="confirm-done__crosslink">Want someone to just fix what the report finds? <a href="https://sitesoncall.com">sitesoncall.com</a></p>
    </div>

    {# Page-level error panel — styled, never a raw crash #}
    <div id="confirm-error" class="confirm-error" hidden aria-live="polite">
      <h1 class="confirm-error__title" id="confirm-error-title">Something went sideways.</h1>
      <p class="confirm-error__body" id="confirm-error-body"></p>
      <p class="confirm-error__help">If this keeps happening, email <a href="mailto:info@untitledpublishers.com">info@untitledpublishers.com</a> with your receipt and we'll sort it out by hand.</p>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<script src="/assets/js/thank-you.js" defer></script>
